WEBVTT

00:34.810 --> 00:36.060
Rudy?

00:36.930 --> 00:39.560
What happened?
Are you okay?

00:45.530 --> 00:47.610
R-Rudy?

00:54.370 --> 00:57.200
I guess you really
weren't okay after all.

00:57.870 --> 01:00.670
I'm here if you need a little comfort.

01:01.370 --> 01:06.300
My future self betrayed
a sweet and kind girl like her.

01:06.840 --> 01:08.990
Sorry, Sylphie.

01:08.990 --> 01:15.310
You know, when I'm hurting,
I might say mean things to you.

01:16.060 --> 01:17.930
What's this all of a sudden?

01:17.930 --> 01:21.270
But please don't leave me.

01:22.480 --> 01:28.530
If that happens, I'd probably get really
upset and have a fight with you.

01:32.860 --> 01:36.240
But we can always make up, right?

01:37.660 --> 01:39.410
Yes, of course.

01:40.040 --> 01:43.000
We can, I'm sure of it.

03:11.550 --> 03:18.970
MUSHOKU TENSEI: JOBLESS REINCARNATION SEASON 3

03:25.730 --> 03:29.730
How have you been feeling lately, Roxy?

03:29.730 --> 03:33.030
I'm fine.
Why do you ask?

03:34.020 --> 03:39.240
Well, I just really want you to live
a nice long life, I guess.

03:39.240 --> 03:44.410
Given the lifespan of our race,
I'm sure I'll outlive you.

03:44.410 --> 03:47.620
I want you to live a long life, too.

03:47.620 --> 03:49.080
Okay.

03:50.790 --> 03:53.130
Both of them are still alive.

03:53.130 --> 03:56.760
I won't let our lives turn out
the way they did in that diary.

03:58.050 --> 04:01.350
I still have something to do,
so I'll head back to my room.

04:01.350 --> 04:03.760
All right.
Do your best, okay?

04:07.940 --> 04:10.730
Rudy's been acting strangely today.

04:10.730 --> 04:11.810
Yes.

04:12.360 --> 04:16.860
Even when he's having a hard day,
he tends to keep it inside.

04:18.070 --> 04:19.660
Let's not pry too much.

04:19.660 --> 04:22.240
We should be ready to support him
when he needs us.

04:22.740 --> 04:23.740
Yes.

04:23.740 --> 04:25.200
DIARY
You're right.

04:25.200 --> 04:26.000
RUDEUS GREYRAT

04:28.000 --> 04:30.670
There are three things
that I need to do:

04:30.670 --> 04:32.840
consult Nanahoshi,

04:32.840 --> 04:36.380
doubt the Man-God
without opposing him,

04:36.380 --> 04:39.090
and write Eris a letter.

04:42.550 --> 04:44.720
Let's start with this.

04:45.260 --> 04:49.390
She was the first woman I slept with,
someone I loved.

04:49.390 --> 04:52.730
And someone who suddenly
disappeared from my life.

04:53.730 --> 04:56.610
I have such complicated feelings
about her.

05:02.350 --> 05:06.160
I'll send this letter after I discuss it
with Sylphie and Roxy.

05:07.540 --> 05:08.870
Big Brother!

05:08.870 --> 05:10.960
Food is ready!

05:11.750 --> 05:12.750
Okay.

05:12.750 --> 05:14.420
Let's eat together!

05:14.420 --> 05:16.920
You've got something on your face, missy.

05:19.420 --> 05:20.970
Thank you!

05:20.970 --> 05:26.560
It seems Aisha kept taking care of me
even when I started acting like scum.

05:27.920 --> 05:30.770
Is there anything you want, Aisha?

05:30.770 --> 05:32.980
Huh? What's this all of a sudden?

05:32.980 --> 05:37.780
Don't tell me you want to bribe me
for Big Sis Sylphie's and Roxy's panties?!

05:37.780 --> 05:40.780
Yes, yes. Let's go eat.

05:40.780 --> 05:42.070
Yes, sir!

05:46.490 --> 05:50.120
The food tasted better
than usual today.

05:50.750 --> 05:52.460
Um... Norn.

05:52.460 --> 05:53.500
Yes?

05:53.500 --> 05:55.630
How's school?

05:55.630 --> 05:57.920
I still need to improve my grades
and swordsmanship,

05:57.920 --> 06:00.010
but I'm doing my best
on the student council.

06:00.010 --> 06:01.300
I see.

06:01.840 --> 06:03.800
If you run into trouble,
tell me right away.

06:03.800 --> 06:04.840
Yes.

06:06.640 --> 06:10.270
Master Rudeus,
is the food not to your liking?

06:10.270 --> 06:13.770
No, it actually tastes better
than usual.

06:13.770 --> 06:16.020
I don't deserve such compliments.

06:16.020 --> 06:20.670
Actually, Aisha's been trying hard
to cheer you up today.

06:28.530 --> 06:33.500
I have to stay strong
for my loving family.

06:39.880 --> 06:43.670
Miss Sylphie, Miss Roxy,
thank you for coming.

06:44.550 --> 06:49.180
Uh, Roxy, has anything been
bothering you lately?

06:49.680 --> 06:53.100
One thing has been on
my mind lately,

06:53.100 --> 06:55.940
but I'd like to be sure
before I tell you.

06:57.100 --> 06:59.270
I look forward to it.

06:59.270 --> 07:02.820
How about you, Sylphie?

07:02.820 --> 07:04.070
Not really.

07:04.070 --> 07:08.950
Maybe just one thing.
Why is my husband hiding things from me?

07:10.160 --> 07:12.450
My bad.

07:15.410 --> 07:18.710
Actually, that's the reason I asked
the two of you to be here tonight.

07:21.460 --> 07:28.090
A few days ago, I met a Blessed Child
with the power to predict the future.

07:28.090 --> 07:32.560
He said someone out there
wants to harm our family.

07:32.560 --> 07:34.770
Why is this person targeting us?

07:34.770 --> 07:36.350
I don't know about that either.

07:36.350 --> 07:39.190
But in the worst case,
someone could die.

07:40.860 --> 07:43.230
Can you really believe that?

07:43.230 --> 07:46.110
Yes, I think you're
worrying too much about this.

07:46.110 --> 07:50.370
Actually, I have my suspicions,
and I'm fairly certain.

07:50.950 --> 07:52.620
I see.

07:54.450 --> 07:56.870
I understand. I believe you.

07:57.870 --> 08:02.040
But you're going to do something
dangerous again, right?

08:02.040 --> 08:04.260
It's likely.

08:04.760 --> 08:08.130
I don't like that.

08:12.760 --> 08:14.470
All right.

08:14.470 --> 08:18.980
While you're out,
I'll protect our family.

08:18.980 --> 08:20.770
Are you okay with that, Roxy?

08:20.770 --> 08:25.860
You know Rudy would rather risk his life
than see his family in danger.

08:25.860 --> 08:27.360
I know, but...

08:27.360 --> 08:32.740
I don't intend to just sit around
and watch him risk his life for us.

08:33.580 --> 08:39.870
We just have to save him
if things get really dangerous.

08:41.580 --> 08:43.169
You're right.

08:43.789 --> 08:46.170
Okay, I understand.

08:46.170 --> 08:50.180
It's best to let Rudy focus on his task
without worrying about us.

08:53.050 --> 08:57.980
So don't worry about things here.
Do what you want to do.

08:57.980 --> 08:59.690
Thank you very much.

09:01.730 --> 09:04.690
There is one more thing, actually...

09:05.440 --> 09:08.570
I'm not sure how to say it, though...

09:08.570 --> 09:11.110
Is it something awkward?

09:12.620 --> 09:14.950
It's not certain yet, but...

09:16.200 --> 09:19.960
There's a chance
I might take another wife.

09:24.920 --> 09:27.210
Who is it? Nanahoshi?

09:27.210 --> 09:29.840
It's not Nanahoshi.

09:31.590 --> 09:33.340
It's a woman named Eris.

09:33.340 --> 09:34.680
Eris?

09:37.100 --> 09:41.390
Wasn't she the one
who caused your illness?

09:41.390 --> 09:44.980
Yeah, I guess she was.

09:44.980 --> 09:47.860
Do you still love her after all that?

09:47.860 --> 09:50.110
I love you more now.

09:52.910 --> 09:57.870
So she wants to make up
after dumping you?

09:57.870 --> 10:00.790
Actually...

10:00.790 --> 10:03.370
I might have been wrong
about her dumping me.

10:05.040 --> 10:08.800
I still remember how much you were
struggling before we got married.

10:09.380 --> 10:13.300
You were really desperate back then,
even more than you are now.

10:13.300 --> 10:16.390
I don't want you to
experience that again.

10:17.810 --> 10:19.310
Thank you.

10:19.310 --> 10:22.140
To be honest, this has been
on my mind lately.

10:22.140 --> 10:26.150
That's why I need
to face her properly.

10:27.190 --> 10:31.440
It seems Eris has been
training hard for my sake.

10:31.440 --> 10:36.660
Wouldn't it be sad if I rejected her
outright after all her hard work?

10:37.200 --> 10:38.490
Rudy...

10:40.200 --> 10:46.380
Yes, I guess I understand
how painful it would be.

10:47.000 --> 10:50.800
After all, I worked hard myself
back in Buena Village to catch up to you.

10:51.210 --> 10:57.090
It's just that I don't know if she really
has been training for your sake.

10:57.090 --> 10:59.310
So you really don't want this, do you?

10:59.310 --> 11:03.680
I'm not saying I don't want it.
I'm just worried.

11:03.680 --> 11:06.810
I'm worried she'll hurt you again.

11:11.330 --> 11:16.030
Excuse me, could we decide this
after we meet Eris?

11:16.030 --> 11:20.030
You can't really make up your mind
until you see her again, right?

11:20.030 --> 11:21.490
You're right.

11:21.490 --> 11:25.210
And you already told him

11:25.210 --> 11:29.210
you wanted him to bring her
to meet us first.

11:31.000 --> 11:32.500
That's right.

11:33.300 --> 11:35.630
I've never met her before.

11:36.550 --> 11:42.640
I thought she must be a mean person,
but maybe I misunderstood.

11:42.640 --> 11:46.440
Maybe she loves you
just as much as I do.

11:46.980 --> 11:50.650
Yes, I'm sure of that, too.

11:51.480 --> 11:54.690
Then bring Eris here
and introduce her to us.

11:54.690 --> 11:58.160
We'll talk, and if it doesn't
seem like it'll work out,

11:58.160 --> 12:01.830
I'll object to the marriage.

12:02.580 --> 12:03.580
Yes.

12:05.830 --> 12:07.540
Thank you, Roxy.

12:07.540 --> 12:11.380
Your feelings have to come first.

12:11.380 --> 12:13.250
I'm sorry, Sylphie.

12:13.250 --> 12:14.550
It's okay.

12:14.550 --> 12:17.220
Thank you for telling us about this.

12:17.220 --> 12:19.260
I'll decide after I meet her.

12:19.260 --> 12:22.720
Then I'll tell you
how I honestly feel.

12:28.100 --> 12:31.360
Good night.

12:31.360 --> 12:34.360
Good night, Sylphie, Roxy.

12:44.120 --> 12:47.120
Had to go and ruin everything...

12:47.120 --> 12:50.040
Returning from the future?
That's not fair.

12:50.040 --> 12:54.130
And everything was going so well, too.

12:54.130 --> 12:59.220
Judging by how upset you are,
that old man was telling the truth?

12:59.220 --> 13:02.640
Well, who knows?

13:02.640 --> 13:07.270
It seems your future self
got plenty of things wrong, too.

13:07.270 --> 13:11.690
Listen, I'll do as my future self said.
I won't oppose you.

13:11.690 --> 13:15.270
So leave my family alone.

13:15.270 --> 13:17.440
You're quite generous, aren't you?

13:17.440 --> 13:21.360
Because you haven't done
anything to me yet.

13:21.360 --> 13:23.870
If possible, I'd like us
to be on good terms.

13:23.870 --> 13:25.580
I see.

13:26.620 --> 13:30.620
If I told you my goal was world peace,
would you believe me?

13:30.620 --> 13:33.210
Sounds great.

13:33.210 --> 13:36.000
"Love and peace" is my motto.

13:36.000 --> 13:38.050
That's great.

13:38.050 --> 13:41.130
You remember the Dragon God?
That Orsted.

13:41.130 --> 13:45.470
His ultimate goal is
to destroy the world.

13:45.470 --> 13:47.010
Is that so?

13:47.010 --> 13:51.270
If I die, this world will break apart
and disappear.

13:51.270 --> 13:55.770
That's why Orsted is
so desperate to kill me.

13:55.770 --> 13:59.490
Then go after Orsted, not me.

13:59.490 --> 14:02.150
That was the plan...

14:04.360 --> 14:06.240
Until you appeared.

14:06.240 --> 14:08.870
What do I have to do with this?

14:08.870 --> 14:11.540
Orsted is very strong,
but he's alone

14:11.540 --> 14:14.080
because of his curse.

14:14.080 --> 14:17.590
As long as he's alone,
he'll never be able to win against me.

14:17.590 --> 14:23.130
But it seems like you and your descendants
are immune to his curse.

14:23.130 --> 14:28.890
In the future, your descendants
and Orsted will defeat me.

14:28.890 --> 14:33.640
I see. So that's why you went after Roxy
when she got pregnant?

14:35.230 --> 14:38.820
Then couldn't you have
just targeted me earlier?

14:38.820 --> 14:40.650
Of course I wanted to.

14:40.650 --> 14:44.660
But your destiny is very strong.

14:44.660 --> 14:46.780
My destiny?
What does that mean?

14:46.780 --> 14:49.410
How should I explain this?

14:49.410 --> 14:53.040
I can see several possible futures,

14:53.040 --> 14:55.170
and I can tamper with them
to some degree.

14:55.170 --> 14:59.500
But I can't easily manipulate
people with strong destinies.

14:59.500 --> 15:01.590
Is that so?

15:01.590 --> 15:05.590
Your wife and your descendants
have strong destinies, too.

15:05.590 --> 15:10.140
But there are times in a woman's life
when her destiny becomes a little unclear.

15:11.180 --> 15:12.520
Do you mean...?

15:12.990 --> 15:17.230
That's right.
When she's carrying a baby.

15:18.110 --> 15:20.980
I thought it was a perfect plan,
you know!

15:20.980 --> 15:24.150
By guiding you step by step,
despite your strong destiny,

15:24.150 --> 15:29.490
the most efficient approach was to strike
when you were most vulnerable.

15:29.950 --> 15:33.290
But I'm not giving up,

15:33.290 --> 15:36.040
because I don't want to die.

15:36.040 --> 15:38.080
I guess so.

15:38.580 --> 15:41.000
Isn't there some other way
to resolve this?

15:41.000 --> 15:44.510
I'm willing to do anything
to save my family.

15:44.510 --> 15:47.890
You said you'd do anything?

15:47.890 --> 15:49.340
Y-Yeah...

15:50.680 --> 15:52.010
Okay then.

15:52.600 --> 15:55.520
Go kill Orsted for me.

15:56.850 --> 15:58.060
Rudy...

15:58.060 --> 16:00.110
Rudy! That hurts!

16:00.650 --> 16:03.030
Rudy!

16:04.530 --> 16:06.490
That hurts, Rudy!

16:07.070 --> 16:08.450
S-Sorry!

16:10.320 --> 16:12.200
Are you all right?

16:12.870 --> 16:15.870
Was that a dream?

16:15.870 --> 16:18.210
No, that wasn't a dream.

16:18.210 --> 16:20.380
It was the Man-God,
no doubt about it.

16:26.300 --> 16:29.220
What's wrong, Rudy?
Are you okay?

16:34.080 --> 16:35.390
Rudy?

16:37.390 --> 16:42.060
It looks like I have to kill someone.

16:44.650 --> 16:48.650
Rudy, what do you mean by that?

16:51.370 --> 16:52.450
Sorry.

17:11.589 --> 17:13.849
I'll kill Orsted.

17:13.849 --> 17:18.099
I'll kill him and protect my family,

17:18.099 --> 17:24.109
even if it costs me my life
and makes my family sad.

17:32.240 --> 17:35.490
Hey, are you sure I look fine?

17:35.490 --> 17:40.370
You'll end up looking a mess
on the way to Sharia anyway.

17:40.370 --> 17:41.710
I guess so.

17:41.710 --> 17:45.130
By the way, I heard a few rumors
about your boyfriend.

17:45.130 --> 17:46.250
What kind of rumors?!

17:46.250 --> 17:48.800
They say he conquered
a legendary labyrinth,

17:48.800 --> 17:51.050
destroyed an immortal demon king,

17:51.050 --> 17:55.100
and put up a good fight against
one of the Seven Great Powers.

17:55.100 --> 17:58.890
That's Rudeus for you!
I'd expect no less!

17:58.890 --> 18:02.810
I also hear he likes girls
with small breasts.

18:04.940 --> 18:06.610
That won't be a problem.

18:06.610 --> 18:11.320
They also say he's a playboy
who's with a different woman every day.

18:14.200 --> 18:15.620
Look, Eris...

18:15.620 --> 18:20.540
It's just a possibility,
but what if he's forgotten about you?

18:23.170 --> 18:25.000
It's just a rumor.

18:26.000 --> 18:27.500
Eris.

18:28.960 --> 18:30.460
Sorry for the wait.

18:30.460 --> 18:34.430
Good grief.
Is Nina the only one here to see us off?

18:34.430 --> 18:36.720
Where's that Gal-boy?

18:36.720 --> 18:41.850
Master, it seems the Sword God
can't hold his liquor.

18:41.850 --> 18:44.940
Are you two returning
to the Kingdom of Asura?

18:44.940 --> 18:45.980
Yes.

18:46.520 --> 18:48.730
It's going to get lonely here
without you.

18:48.730 --> 18:52.820
If you ever visit the Kingdom of Asura,
please come see me.

18:52.820 --> 18:54.740
I'll show you around.

18:54.740 --> 18:56.110
No, thanks.

18:56.110 --> 18:59.160
A country bumpkin like me
would get laughed at there.

18:59.160 --> 19:03.540
Hmph! Just cut down anyone
who dares laugh at us.

19:05.670 --> 19:08.210
It's not funny when you say it.

19:08.210 --> 19:10.710
That's right. Just punch them.
That should be enough.

19:10.710 --> 19:11.510
Agreed!

19:11.510 --> 19:13.420
That's not what I meant!

19:13.420 --> 19:15.800
All right then, shall we depart?

19:15.800 --> 19:16.550
Okay!

19:16.550 --> 19:19.180
Eris!

19:19.180 --> 19:21.930
You got a letter from Rudeus!

19:21.930 --> 19:23.180
Rudeus?!

19:42.950 --> 19:45.750
Hey, what does it say?

19:45.750 --> 19:49.460
Shut up!
I haven't learned some of these words.

19:49.460 --> 19:50.710
Read it for me, Nina!

19:50.710 --> 19:53.510
Huh?!
I can't read either, you know!

19:53.960 --> 19:57.590
Calm down. I'll read it instead.

19:57.590 --> 19:58.590
Thanks.

20:00.010 --> 20:05.810
"Dear Miss Eris, it's been a while.
This is Rudeus Greyrat.

20:06.340 --> 20:09.900
Do you still remember
our first night together?

20:09.900 --> 20:15.070
Back then, I swore to myself
that I'd stay with you forever.

20:15.070 --> 20:20.120
But when I woke up in the morning,
you were already gone.

20:20.120 --> 20:26.250
The sorrow and emptiness of that moment
cast a deep darkness over my heart."

20:28.460 --> 20:31.210
B-But I left a note.

20:32.130 --> 20:40.640
"I'm writing this because someone said
you'd never stopped loving me.

20:40.640 --> 20:44.390
Up until now, I was convinced
that you'd abandoned me.

20:44.890 --> 20:51.980
If your heart remains unchanged,
I'm prepared to accept your feelings.

20:51.980 --> 20:58.740
But I have two wives now,
so you would become my third.

20:58.740 --> 21:04.160
If you find this unacceptable,
I'm prepared to let you punch me.

21:04.160 --> 21:06.240
Even if you're not
willing to join my family,

21:06.240 --> 21:10.920
I hope we can at least
become good friends.

21:10.920 --> 21:12.500
Yours truly."

21:13.710 --> 21:17.090
How awful! That man clearly
has no respect for women!

21:17.090 --> 21:19.800
It sounded like he was trying
to be considerate, though.

21:19.800 --> 21:22.930
Considerate?!
He didn't even say, "I love you"!

21:22.930 --> 21:26.010
Eris is also at fault here for
wandering off without telling him.

21:26.010 --> 21:28.520
He's probably only after Eris's body!

21:28.520 --> 21:31.190
If that is true,
then he's treading a dangerous path.

21:31.190 --> 21:36.400
Eris, don't go to Sharia!
Just come with us to Asura!

21:36.930 --> 21:38.780
Hey, there's another page here.

21:38.780 --> 21:39.900
Oh my.

21:40.360 --> 21:41.990
Let's see...

21:41.990 --> 21:48.620
"P.S. I'm going to challenge
Dragon God Orsted.

21:49.790 --> 21:52.420
I don't know if I can win,

21:52.420 --> 21:57.420
but if I do make it back alive,
let's talk about this properly."

22:02.510 --> 22:05.800
We've got to hurry
if we want to get there in time.

22:06.640 --> 22:08.310
Let's go, Ghislaine!

22:09.780 --> 22:11.940
Be careful!

22:15.400 --> 22:17.270
I'm on my way,

22:17.270 --> 22:18.860
EPISODE 14: RESOLVE
Rudeus!

22:18.860 --> 22:19.570
EPISODE 14: RESOLVE

23:34.980 --> 23:39.980
THANK YOU FOR WATCHING!
LOOK FORWARD TO THE SECOND COUR!
